I2C Read Frame 
--------------

Dummy write (Register address write) : 

	* Used to set the slave's internal address pointer 
	* No data is written to memory 
	* Required before a read operation 

	Random read : 

		* Allows reading from any memory / register location 
		* Implemented using dummy write + repeated START + read 
	
		





























	

